<title>POLAND: Polish Izolacja to start bourse trade on March 17.</title>
<headline>Polish Izolacja to start bourse trade on March 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insulation materials maker  Izolacja SA will start bourse trade on the exchange's main floor on March 17, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company's 100,130-share November initial public offering, priced at 120 zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
